<h2 class="g-h2" id="accessibility">Accessibility</h2>
<div class="g-prose">
  <p>Use <code>&lt;button type="button"&gt;</code> for an action and <code>&lt;a href&gt;</code> for navigation; never a link without an <code>href</code>. A button with only an icon needs <code>aria-label</code>. A disabled button leaves the tab order, so say near it why the action is unavailable. A link that opens a new tab says so in its text or icon.</p>
  <p>Every control keeps the visible focus ring <code>styles.css</code> gives <code>:focus-visible</code>: 2px <code>primary-600</code>, offset 2px.</p>
</div>

